                    Secret; Priority. Drafted by Hoffacker and John R. Clingerman of AFC; cleared by
                    O’Sullivan, Williams, Colonel Gall, Davis, and Harriman; and approved by Palmer.
                    Repeated to Leopoldville.</p>
